  Derived files (each lists the ported functions in its header):
    types.ts          from libass/ass_types.h
    cstr.ts           from libass/ass_utils.h, ass_utils.c, ass_strtod.c, ass_string.h
    parse.ts          from libass/ass.c, ass_utils.c, ass_utils.h (script parsing, [Fonts] decoding)
    font-tables.ts    from libass/ass_fontselect.c (get_font_info), ass_font.c (weight, style, metrics)
    fonts.ts          from libass/ass_fontselect.c (matching, fallback), ass_font.c (faces, synthetic styles, size)
    state.ts          from libass/ass_render.h, ass_render.c (render context), ass_parse.c (ass_update_font)
    tags.ts           from libass/ass_parse.c (override tags, animation, fades)
    events.ts         from libass/ass_render.h (GlyphInfo), ass_render.c, ass_parse.c (karaoke)
    drawing.ts        from libass/ass_drawing.c
    layout.ts         from libass/ass_render.c (layout, wrapping, alignment), ass_shaper.c (runs), ass_font.c
    transform.ts      from libass/ass_render.c (calc_transform_matrix, calculate_rotation_params)
    collisions.ts     from libass/ass_render.c (fix_collisions)
    frame.ts          from libass/ass_render.c (ass_render_frame, event boxes, device positions)
    raster.ts         from libass/ass_render.c (filters, quantize_transform positions, composition, clips),
                          ass_bitmap.c (ass_fix_outline), ass_font.c (emboldening, italic, decorations)
  gsub.ts, measure.ts, warp.ts, renderer.ts, trace.ts and trace-format.ts are original implementations; they
  contain no libass, libbluray or FFmpeg code.

